array_clear.markdown:
Replaces the contents of an array with the given value.
```
var arr = [1, 2, 3];
array_clear(arr, 4);
trace(arr); // [4, 4, 4]
```

array_clone.markdown:
Returns a shallow copy of the given array.
```
var a = [1, 2, 3];
var b = array_clone(a);
a[1] = 4;
trace(a); // [1, 4, 3]
trace(b); // [1, 2, 3]
```

current_frame_get_repeat.markdown:
